<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls to 6.52 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls to 6.52 pct on 3-mo Italy BOTs.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 13.00 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     6.52	(6.72)    98.40	  (98.30)</p>
<p>    6-month     6.32	(6.61)    96.93	  (96.74)</p>
<p>    1-year	6.55	(6.86)    93.85	  (93.55)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on April 22.</p>
</text>
